{"id":887676,"title":"Q8｜微调：是否将因技术发展变得鸡肋？","content":"<blockquote>\n<p>作者介绍：邢云阳，某大厂 AI 与容器技术专家</p>\n</blockquote><p><span class=\"orange\">Q：MCP 的出现让微调显得鸡肋，因为私有数据都可以通过 MCP 得到，唯一的问题是模型支持的上下文长度是否足够长？</span></p><p><span class=\"orange\">（注：以下内容截取自极客时间专栏<a href=\"https://time.geekbang.org/column/intro/100995901\">《DeepSeek 应用开发实战》</a>）</span></p><p><strong>邢云阳：</strong>首先我们要想明白一个点，那就是 MCP 只是一个协议，是为了大家按统一标准做 AI 开发，大家生产的 tool 可以互相无缝衔接调用，所以抛开这个协议，MCP 能干的事情，用 Agent 一样能干。</p><p>那清楚这一点后，我们就可以去理解为什么有 Agent 技术了，还要做微调。这是因为 Agent 做得再好，也始终是需要借助外力的。就好比你问我问题，我如果脑子里有（相当于微调），我就可以直接回复你，省时省力，如果我没有，那我就得去百度（相当于 Agent ）。所以，微调肯定比 Agent 效果好，但也比 Agent 难度大很多很多，这也是微调的普及性不如 Agent 的原因。</p><!-- [[[read_end]]] -->","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":401589,"user_name":"阿鸡","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1589246,"ip_address":"新加坡","ucode":"F181422D4EB444","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/18/3f/fe/35d1afbd.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1752804746,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101055501,"comment_content":"实际应用中微调的优先级会远低于agent","like_count":1},{"had_liked":false,"id":403902,"user_name":"enjoylearning","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1000237,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"DCAF8538DEA277","user_header":"","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1765291304,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101055501,"comment_content":"能从模型直接输出当然最好，不过消耗的成本是否值得","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":401747,"user_name":"Whisper","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":2979185,"ip_address":"江苏","ucode":"261A9F4CEB14D3","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/2d/75/71/621a214a.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1753609143,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101055501,"comment_content":"微调应该解决的只是某些定制化需求，有点类似于各种通用场景中的corner case，因此难度比起能覆盖绝大多数场景的agent难得多","like_count":0}]}